# xorg-server patch series. All entries PLANNED (commented out).
#
# Source of candidates: oi-userland components/x11/xorg-server/patches
# (40 patches against 1.19.7; snapshot 2026-11-24). Forward-port only what
# a modesetting + glamor desktop needs; the Sun/Trusted Extensions, DMX,
# sparc and dtlogin patches are out of scope.
#
# 0001-sun-paths.patch            from OI 02-sun-paths.patch (review)
# 0002-vt.patch                   from OI 19-vt.patch: illumos VT switching
#                                 (vt(4I), /dev/vt/N); needed so Xorg can
#                                 drmDropMaster/drmSetMaster on VT switch
# 0003-amd64-loader-path.patch    from OI 09-amd64-loader-path.patch (review;
#                                 may be moot with -Dmodule_dir)
# 0004-modesetting-pci-probe.patch
#   hw/xfree86/drivers/modesetting: confirm the non-udev PCI probe path
#   (ms_pci_probe -> drmOpen by bus id) is compiled on SunOS and that
#   glamor's DRI3 paths do not assume Linux (believed portable: OpenBSD and
#   FreeBSD use the same driver).
# 0005-os-support-solaris-drm.patch
#   hw/xfree86/os-support/solaris: keep vgatext/illumosfb console handoff
#   from fighting KMS (do not KDSETMODE the console framebuffer while the
#   DRM driver owns the display).
